@startuml
title 适老化打车平台 - 就医优先派单完整链路时序图 (Medical Priority Dispatch Sequence)

actor "老年用户" as User
participant "APP前端\n(React Native)" as App
participant "后端API\n(Backend API)" as API
participant "POI识别服务\n(POI Service)" as POI
participant "派单引擎\n(Dispatch Engine)" as Dispatch
participant "司机端" as Driver
participant "亲友端" as Family
participant "SMS网关" as SMS

== 1. 目的地输入 ==
User -> App: 说出目的地\n"我要去人民医院"
activate App
App -> App: 语音识别: "人民医院"
App -> App: 解析意图: RIDE_TO

App -> API: POST /api/v1/poi/classify\n{name: "人民医院", lat, lng}
activate API
API -> POI: 查询POI类别
activate POI
POI -> POI: 搜索POI数据库\n关键词: "人民医院"
POI -> POI: 匹配分类: hospital\n置信度: 0.98
POI --> API: {category: "hospital", confidence: 0.98, subCategory: "general_hospital"}
deactivate POI

API -> API: 判断目的地类型
alt 置信度 >= 0.8
  API -> API: 自动标记: priorityType = "hospital"
  note right: 竞品启发(P4)\n滴滴已验证202k+次\n就医优先派单
else 置信度 < 0.8
  API --> App: 返回候选POI列表
  App --> User: 展示候选列表\n"请选择目的地类型"
  User -> App: 选择"医院"
end

API --> App: 返回POI分类结果\n{category: "hospital", priorityType: "hospital"}
deactivate API

== 2. 就医优先确认 ==
App -> App: 大字弹窗确认\n"目的地: 人民医院(医院)\n为您开启就医优先派单"
App -> App: TTS播报: "检测到目的地为医院，为您优先匹配附近车辆"

alt 用户确认
  User -> App: 点击"确认叫车"
  App -> App: 构建订单请求\n{priorityType: "hospital"}
else 用户取消(非医院)
  User -> App: 点击"这不是医院"
  App -> App: 构建订单请求\n{priorityType: "normal"}
  note right: 用户可手动关闭\n就医优先标识
end

== 3. 就医优先派单 ==
App -> API: POST /api/v1/rides\n{userId, pickup, destination, priorityType: "hospital"}
activate API
API -> API: 创建订单\n(priorityType: hospital)

API -> Dispatch: 派单请求\n{priorityType: "hospital", location, matchRadius: 2000}
activate Dispatch

Dispatch -> Dispatch: 查询附近司机\n(半径: 2km)
Dispatch -> Dispatch: 计算匹配权重\n\n权重公式:\n  score = baseScore\n        + hospital_boost × 1.5\n        + distance_decay × 0.8\n        + rating_bonus × 0.2

note right of Dispatch
  就医优先权重策略:
  - 医院目的地: ×1.5 权重提升
  - 距离衰减: ×0.8 (扩大范围)
  - 高评分司机: ×0.2 加成
  - 扩大半径: 2km→3km→5km
end note

Dispatch -> Dispatch: 排序候选司机\n(按加权分降序)

Dispatch -> Driver: 推送订单\n"就医优先-人民医院\n上车点: 幸福小区\n额外补贴: ¥5.00"
activate Driver
Driver -> Driver: 查看订单
Driver --> Dispatch: 接单确认
deactivate Driver

Dispatch --> API: 司机已匹配\n{driverId, eta: 3min, priority: "hospital"}
deactivate Dispatch

API -> API: 更新订单状态: assigned\n(记录priorityType: hospital)
API --> App: 返回订单信息\n{orderId, driver, eta: 3min, priorityBanner: "就医优先"}
deactivate API

== 4. 就医优先保障 ==
App -> App: 大字展示\n"就医优先派单成功\n司机: 王师傅\n预计到达: 3分钟\n(比普通派单快约40%)"
App -> App: TTS播报: "就医优先派单成功，司机预计3分钟到达"
App --> User: 展示确认信息

alt 3分钟无司机接单
  App -> API: 请求扩大匹配范围
  activate API
  API -> Dispatch: expandMatchRange(orderId, 3000→5000)
  activate Dispatch
  Dispatch -> Dispatch: 扩大半径至5km
  Dispatch -> Driver: 扩大范围推送
  Dispatch --> API: 匹配范围已扩大
  deactivate Dispatch
  API --> App: 推送"正在扩大范围找车"
  deactivate API
  App -> App: TTS播报: "正在扩大范围为您找车，请稍候"
end

== 5. 行程通知亲友 ==
App -> API: POST /api/v1/safety/notify-family\n{orderId, familyContacts, medicalNote: true}
activate API
API -> Family: 推送就医行程通知\n"父亲正在前往人民医院\n就医优先派单\n司机: 王师傅 京A·12345\n预计到达: 3分钟"
activate Family
Family --> API: 确认收到
deactivate Family
API --> App: 亲友已通知
deactivate API

== 6. 就医到达通知 ==
Driver -> API: 到达人民医院
activate API
API -> API: 更新订单状态: arrived
API --> App: 推送到达通知
deactivate API

App -> App: TTS播报: "已到达人民医院，祝您顺利"
App --> User: 大字显示"已到达人民医院"

API -> Family: 推送就医到达通知\n"父亲已到达人民医院"
activate Family
Family --> API: 确认收到
deactivate Family

== 7. 行后关怀 ==
API -> App: 推送就医关怀\n"您已到达医院，祝您早日康复"
App -> App: 大字展示关怀信息

API -> SMS: 发送就医到达通知(可选)
activate SMS
SMS --> User: "已到达人民医院\n祝您一切顺利"
deactivate SMS

API -> API: 记录就医派单统计\n- 订单ID: xxx\n- 派单时间: 2.5min\n- 节省时间: 40% vs 普通派单\n- 司机补贴: ¥5.00

@enduml